# Qdrant snapshots are tens to hundreds of MB and contain the very payloads
# this repo is trying to get out of circulation. They belong on the operator's
# disk, never in git history -- see the 2026-05 git-history purge referenced in
# AGENT_PLAN.md 3.1. Manifests are small and safe, but they name collections
# and point counts, so they are ignored too.
*
!.gitignore
